[Rewrite]
response if ${url} ~= /^https?:\/\/[a-z]+\.xiaohongshu\.com\/api\/sns\/v\d\/(homefeed|localfeed)/i then response.json.jq(".data |= map(select(.type == \"normal\"))")

[MITM]
hostname = *.xiaohongshu.com

